            "Return convention = the same adjusted Close-to-Close basis used by R6/R12b.\n"
            "No cap/floor/leverage/threshold/lookback sweep/Brake/post-hoc rescue. DEV cutoff=2026-07-31.\n"
            "Do not transplant to Attack75 or Promotion100 from these in-sample results.\n"
